  description="Legal disclaimer for fitzroyminerals.com. Accuracy of information, forward-looking statements, and investment decision notice for Fitzroy Minerals Ltd."
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Legal' }, { label: 'Disclaimer' }]}
  pageHeading="Legal Disclaimer"
>

  <div class="legal-body">

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2>Accuracy of Information</h2>
      <p>
        Readers are directed to the public disclosure of Fitzroy Minerals Ltd. ("Fitzroy") available
        under Fitzroy's profile on the System for Electronic Document Analysis and Retrieval
        ("SEDAR+") at{' '}
        <a href="https://www.sedarplus.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          www.sedarplus.ca ↗
        </a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Information on this website was believed to be accurate at the time it was posted, but may
        be superseded by more recent public disclosure of Fitzroy. Fitzroy makes no representations
        or warranties as to the accuracy, reliability, completeness or timeliness of the information
        on this website.
      </p>
